# This directory intentionally left mostly empty.
# vercel.json sets framework:null (to avoid Vercel's Express zero-config
# auto-detection scanning src/ for an entrypoint), which makes Vercel
# expect a static Output Directory named 'public' to exist even though
# this project is API-only (served entirely by api/index.ts). This
# placeholder file satisfies that check without shadowing any app route.
